    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25826" root="ضرو and ضرى" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِرَآءٌ</span></b> , a pl. epithet, [of which the sing. is probably ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُرِىٌّ</span></b> ,] <i>Courageous:</i> hence, in a trad.,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّ فِينَا ضِرَآءُ ٱللّٰهِ</span> [<i>Verily among us are the champions of God</i>]. (TA.)

